{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-2co-10-1","title":"2 Corinthians 10:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Against the false apostles, who disgraced the weakness of his person and bodily presence, he shows the spiritual might and authority with which he was armed against all adverse powers; 7 assuring them that at his coming he will be found as mighty in word as he is now in writing, being absent; 12 and withal taxing them for reaching out themselves beyond their compass, and vaunting themselves of other men's labours.</p>\n<p>I Paul. 1Co 16:21,22; Ga 5:2; 2Th 3:17; Phm 1:9; Re 1:9 beseech. 2; 5:20; 6:1; Ro 12:1; Eph 4:1; 1Pe 2:11 by. Ps 45:4; Isa 42:3,4; Zec 9:9; Mt 11:29; 12:19,20; 21:5; Ac 8:32 1Pe 2:22,23 presence. or, outward appearance. 7,10 base.Rather, lowly, or humble, [tapeinos ,] which some think refers to his lowness of stature.</p>\n<p>10; 11:30; 12:5,7-9; 13:4; 1Co 2:3; 4:10; Ga 4:13 bold. 3:12; *marg: 7:4; 11:21; 13:2,3; Ro 10:20; 15:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-10-2","title":"2 Corinthians 10:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>that I. 12:20; 13:2,10; 1Co 4:19-21 think. or, reckon. we walked. 11:9-13; 12:13-19; Ro 8:1,5; Ga 5:16-25; Eph 2:2,3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-10-3","title":"2 Corinthians 10:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>walk. Ga 2:20; 1Pe 4:1,2 we do. 4; Ro 8:13; 1Ti 1:18; 2Ti 2:3,4; 4:7; Heb 12:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-10-4","title":"2 Corinthians 10:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>the weapons. 6:7; Ro 6:13; *marg: Ro 13:12; Eph 6:13-18; 1Th 5:8 our. 1Ti 1:18; 2Ti 2:3 mighty. 3:5; 4:7; 13:3,4; Jud 7:13-23; 15:14-16; 1Sa 17:45-50; Ps 110:2 Isa 41:14-16; Zec 4:6,7; Ac 7:22; 1Co 1:18-24; 2:5; 2Co 13:3 Heb 11:32,33 through God. or, to God. to the. Jos 6:20; Isa 30:25; Jer 1:10; Heb 11:30</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-10-5","title":"2 Corinthians 10:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>down. Lu 1:51; Ac 4:25,26; Ro 1:21; 1Co 1:19,27-29; 3:19 imaginations. or, reasonings. and every. Ex 5:2; 9:16,17; 2Ki 19:22,28; Job 40:11,12; 42:6; Ps 10:4; 18:27 Isa 2:11,12,17; 60:14; Eze 17:24; Da 4:37; 5:23-30; Ac 9:4-6 Php 3:4-9; 2Th 2:4,8 bringing. Mt 11:29,30; Ro 7:23 every thought. Ge 8:21; De 15:9; Ps 139:2; Pr 15:26; 24:9; Isa 55:7; 59:7; Jer 4:14 Mt 15:19; Heb 4:12 the obedience. Ps 18:44; 110:2,3; Ro 1:5; 16:26; Heb 5:9; 1Pe 1:2,14,15,22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-10-6","title":"2 Corinthians 10:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>in. 13:2,10; Nu 16:26-30; Ac 5:3-11; 13:10,11; 1Co 4:21; 5:3-5; 1Ti 1:20 3Jo 1:10 when. 2:9; 7:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-10-7","title":"2 Corinthians 10:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>ye look. 1; *marg: 5:12; 1Sa 16:7; Mt 23:5; Lu 16:15; Joh 7:24; Ro 2:28,29 If. 1Co 3:23; 14:37; 15:23; Ga 3:29 even. 5:12; 11:4,18,23; 12:11; 13:3; 1Co 9:1; Ga 1:11-13; 2:5-9; 1Jo 4:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-10-8","title":"2 Corinthians 10:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>though. 1:24; 13:2,3,8,10; Ga 1:1 I should not. 7:14; 12:6; 2Ti 1:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-10-9","title":"2 Corinthians 10:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>terrify. 10; 1Co 4:5,19-21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-10-10","title":"2 Corinthians 10:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>say they. Gr. saith he. 11 but. 1; 12:5-9; 1Co 2:3,4; Ga 4:13,14 and his. 11:6; Ex 4:10; Jer 1:6; 1Co 1:17,21; 2:1-4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-10-11","title":"2 Corinthians 10:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>such. 12:20; 13:2,3,10; 1Co 4:19,20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-10-12","title":"2 Corinthians 10:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>we dare not. 3:1; 5:12; Job 12:2; Pr 25:27; 27:2; Lu 18:11; Ro 15:18 are not wise. or, understand it not. Pr 26:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-10-13","title":"2 Corinthians 10:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>we will not. 15; Pr 25:14 according. 14; Mt 25:15; Ro 12:6; 15:20; 1Co 12:11; Eph 4:7; 1Pe 4:10 rule. or, line. Ps 19:4; Isa 28:17; Ro 10:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-10-14","title":"2 Corinthians 10:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>we stretch not. 3:1-3; Ro 15:18,19; 1Co 2:10; 3:5,10; 4:15; 9:1,2 the gospel. 4:4; Mr 1:1; Ac 20:24; Ro 1:16; 2:16; 16:25; Ga 1:6-8; Col 1:5 1Ti 1:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-10-15","title":"2 Corinthians 10:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>boasting. 13; Ro 15:20 enlarged by you. or, magnified in you.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-10-16","title":"2 Corinthians 10:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>preach. Ro 15:24-28 line. or, rule. 13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-10-17","title":"2 Corinthians 10:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>Ps 105:3; 106:5; Isa 41:16; 45:25; 65:16; Jer 4:2; 9:23,24 Ro 5:11; *Gr: 1Co 1:29,31; Ga 6:13,14; Php 3:3; *Gr: Jas 1:9,10; *Gr:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-10-18","title":"2 Corinthians 10:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>not. 12; 3:1; 5:12; Pr 21:2; 27:2; Lu 16:15; 18:10-14 approved. 6:4; 13:7; Ac 2:22; Ro 14:18; 16:10; 1Co 11:19; 2Ti 2:15 but. Mt 25:20-23; Joh 5:42-44; 12:43; Ro 2:29; 1Co 4:5; 1Pe 1:7</p>"}]}